{'symbol': 'MKC', 'date': '2022-05-02 06:30:00', 'title': 'BRENDAN FOLEY NAMED CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER AND PRESIDENT FOR MCCORMICK', 'text': 'HUNT VALLEY, MD. , MAY 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MCCORMICK & COMPANY, INCORPORATED (NYSE: MKC), A GLOBAL LEADER IN FLAVOR, ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF BRENDAN FOLEY TO THE ROLE OF CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER AND PRESIDENT, EFFECTIVE JUNE 1, 2022.'}